    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n110271" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαντᾰσ-ιώδης</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fantastic,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτοῖαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VA</u>
					7.14
				</span></i>
			; <i>unreal, imaginary,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. ὕπνοι</span>”
				<i>troubled by dreams,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					1.361
				</span></i>
			 (
				Comp.
			); of persons, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. τοῖς
			ὀνείρασιν</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				327
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>showy, pompous,</i> of persons, <i><span class="en">
				Vett.Val.
				39.1
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόξα</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				355.12
			</span></i>; 
