				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>EM</u>
					506.47
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεστός.</span>
			
			Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-δῶς,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1699.35
			</span></i>.</div>
